    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>Generated from:  MR::FastInSphereTesterSoS

gives exactly the same answers as InSphereTesterSoS, only faster: the sphere&apos;s center is also
computed in floating point during reset(), and every query point far enough from the sphere&apos;s
surface is answered by it alone, leaving the exact predicates for the points close to it
</verbatim> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
